OL,3,GNEWSAFire that damaged allotments
OL,4,Athought to be arson
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire which swept through a town's
OL,7,Fallotments is thought to have been
OL,8,Fstarted deliberately.
OL,10,FResidents had to leave their homes for
OL,11,Fseveral hours after flames were spotted
OL,12,Fon Bradford Road in Trowbridge,
OL,13,FWiltshire, at about 21:02 BST on
OL,14,FSunday. The fire spread through wooden
OL,15,Fsheds and people were urged to avoid
OL,16,Fthe area while crews from four fire
OL,17,Fstations were called to the scene.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
