OL,3,GNEWSAFire that damaged allotments
OL,4,Athought to be arson
OL,5,
OL,6,FStewart Palmen, a councillor for
OL,7,FTrowbridge Central, paid tribute to the
OL,8,Ffire service and wrote on Facebook that
OL,9,F"it is believed" the fire was arson. He
OL,10,Fadded: "Police are working hard to
OL,11,Fidentify and prosecute the arsonist."
OL,13,FWiltshire Police said the fire was
OL,14,F"potentially started deliberately" and
OL,15,Fis investigating.
